    "body": "I think the browser on the left is doing it right. The tall legend eats all available space by pushing the border down, but negative content box sizes are not allowed (which browser 2 and 3 seem to allow), so it should be clamped to 0. The browser on the ~~left~~ right stretches the content box, which also seems wrong.",
