    "updated_at": "2018-09-10T14:58:31Z",
    "body": "I think they're all wrong. ^_^ Why shouldn't the height of the fieldset be honored? It seems to me that the legend can be centered on the top border, and the fieldset can grow downwards from there with the specified size (and have the legend stick out below if it's tall enough). Is there some reason this wouldn't work?",
