    "updated_at": "2018-09-10T15:33:36Z",
    "body": "Maybe they're all wrong, yeah. It's not obvious at all that the legend should be part of the content box, since it's taken out and placed with the border, above any padding. So it's part of the border area? Your suggested rendering would make sense then, as long as box-sizing is content-box.\r\n\r\nI think we've discussed this before, but didn't reach agreement.",
